WEBVTT

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:05.768
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:10.040
Todoke Message

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:19.374
'Itsudemo anato wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:20.653
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:28.695
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.024
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:36.431
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:40.933
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:45.034
Aruiteyuki koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:49.441
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:53.017
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:57.346
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:01.491
Todoke Message

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:09.995
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:14.373
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:18.574
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.045 --> 00:01:28.477
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:40.022
Ryuki Shi was seemingly becoming
more and more competent...

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.398
...as the King of Saiunkoku
each day.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.061
He would clearly state his opinions
in the Royal Court...

00:01:46.139 --> 00:01:48.369
...form conclusions from
the opinions of his ministers...

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.899
...and actively involve himself
in government affairs.

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:56.639
He really is becoming
more like a king, isn't he?

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:59.814
Because he's got a great teacher.

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:03.882
Now then, I ask that you
give this suggestion some thought...

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:06.858
...and state your opinion to me
before the end of the day.

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:12.887
Lacking the Finishing Touch

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:21.337
I see. The king...!

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:22.609
Yes.

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:25.601
I hear that even in the Royal Court
he comes forward with his opinions.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:29.645
Then I guess it's about time
I pack my things and go home.

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:35.452
If the king is dealing
with affairs of state properly...

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:38.457
...there's no need for me to stay here
at the palace any longer.

00:02:38.525 --> 00:02:40.993
I should start classes
at the temple school soon, too.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.028
And with the summer
banquet season coming up...

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.996
...I'm sure I'll be asked
to perform.

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.123
The king will be very lonely.

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:52.895
This isn't the place
where I should be living my life.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.301
What a lovely scent.

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:26.105
Korin prepared it for you.

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:28.437
She refers to it as her
secret scent.

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:29.600
Korin did?

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:30.574
Yes.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:34.704
She was worried, saying, "the consort
seems a little under the weather".

00:03:37.817 --> 00:03:38.841
I see.

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:43.080
Please thank Korin for me,
won't you?

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:44.453
I will do that.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:47.359
I will pass on your thanks.

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:50.959
Well then, excuse me.

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:41.575
Anything unusual?

00:04:41.648 --> 00:04:42.672
No, sir!

00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:44.209
Very well.

00:04:54.427 --> 00:04:57.521
I thought it would be a breeze since
I have a map of the palace.

00:04:58.264 --> 00:04:59.458
That's it!

00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:01.998
This map is wrong!

00:05:02.068 --> 00:05:05.663
Otherwise, there's no way
I could get lost!

00:05:06.039 --> 00:05:09.167
It was you, wasn't it?!
Why do you have to interfere?!

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:10.299
What was that?

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:22.143
That's what he wants, right?!

00:05:23.022 --> 00:05:24.284
It's coming from there.

00:05:25.525 --> 00:05:28.289
I wanna be of use to him too!

00:05:28.594 --> 00:05:30.296
It's coming from here.

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:32.821
Making such a racket
at this time of night!

00:05:32.899 --> 00:05:34.924
If it's for him, I would...

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.532
Hey!

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:44.234
Korin!

00:05:45.511 --> 00:05:47.138
Is anyone there?!

00:05:47.213 --> 00:05:49.113
Check Consort Hong's room!

00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:50.308
Don't tell me...!

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.144
Consort Hong!

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.012
She's not here.

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:01.556
Shit.

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:02.651
Shuei!

00:06:03.429 --> 00:06:04.760
Where's Shurei?!

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:07.465
What a surprise. You didn't get lost.

00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:09.524
This isn't the time
for comments like that!

00:06:10.336 --> 00:06:14.397
Where's Seiran?
You'd think he'd be the first one here.

00:06:18.945 --> 00:06:20.139
What's going on?

00:06:21.848 --> 00:06:22.872
Your Majesty.

00:06:56.115 --> 00:06:59.915
But we switched Korin's drugged
incense with a non-lethal substitute.

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:03.715
Which means there
are others involved as well.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:09.357
To vanish with Lady Shurei like smoke
in these guarded grounds.

00:07:09.729 --> 00:07:11.856
These guys are professionals.

00:07:12.131 --> 00:07:16.363
Still, at least Korin's motive
has been established.

00:07:16.436 --> 00:07:18.700
And she's involved with
this other person.

00:07:18.771 --> 00:07:22.468
Although surely he didn't expect
Korin to act as she did.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.711
I wanted to deal with this
a little more discreetly...

00:07:26.779 --> 00:07:29.873
...but now that it's come to this,
I have no choice. Shuei.

00:07:30.383 --> 00:07:32.908
Arrest that man immediately.

00:07:32.985 --> 00:07:34.077
Yes, sir.

00:07:34.454 --> 00:07:37.617
Koyu, you stay with Korin
until she wakes up.

00:07:38.157 --> 00:07:41.524
Secretly inform only Shoka
about this.

00:07:42.728 --> 00:07:44.696
Also, people may get injured.

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:47.224
In order to ensure the injured
are treated quickly...

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:51.236
...wake Doctor To and all
the royal physicians under him.

00:07:51.671 --> 00:07:52.660
Right away.

00:07:56.609 --> 00:07:57.940
By the way, Your Majesty...

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.444
...there's one other person
who remains unaccounted for.

00:08:02.415 --> 00:08:07.512
It's odd that Seiran's nowhere to
be found. Do you think he...!

00:08:07.587 --> 00:08:08.781
You're wrong.

00:08:09.155 --> 00:08:10.520
Your basis?

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:11.887
I have none.

00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:13.789
That's hardly persuasive.

00:08:14.994 --> 00:08:16.359
Your Majesty.

00:08:16.429 --> 00:08:19.660
I heard that you didn't give
Seiran a flower.

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:21.294
Why is that?

00:08:22.568 --> 00:08:24.559
Because it's not necessary.

00:08:25.271 --> 00:08:26.636
Not necessary?

00:08:28.207 --> 00:08:30.300
There's no need to confirm
his true feelings.

00:08:30.376 --> 00:08:33.777
Seiran would not betray
Shurei or me.

00:08:33.846 --> 00:08:36.906
In the same way I have no doubt
in my mind that you two...

00:08:36.983 --> 00:08:40.544
...who willingly accepted my flowers,
will serve me.

00:08:41.954 --> 00:08:45.981
Well, it seems you estimate
our worth to be very high.

00:08:46.058 --> 00:08:48.390
I'm not estimating. I know.

00:08:48.961 --> 00:08:52.897
Stubborn and unyielding,
always poised to take action...

00:08:52.965 --> 00:08:55.297
...never pandering to
those in power...

00:08:55.368 --> 00:08:58.064
...with high self-respect
that borders on arrogance...

00:08:58.137 --> 00:09:01.106
...unwavering in self-confidence
and faith...

00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:04.533
...and never bowing before those
who are unreasonable.

00:09:06.078 --> 00:09:08.603
Is he praising us?

00:09:08.681 --> 00:09:09.943
Not sure...!

00:09:10.516 --> 00:09:11.881
Well then, Your Majesty.

00:09:12.184 --> 00:09:15.347
In your eyes,
Seiran is innocent?

00:09:15.721 --> 00:09:16.779
Yes.

00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:20.052
You pass, Your Majesty.

00:09:22.762 --> 00:09:23.854
What's that?

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.828
A note given to me by Seiran.

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:28.161
A note?

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:33.232
In fact, he told me not to show you...

00:09:33.306 --> 00:09:36.104
...but I see no harm, given your
insistence that he's innocent.

00:09:49.121 --> 00:09:51.453
Huh? Aren't you surprised?

00:09:51.757 --> 00:09:54.225
What are you saying?!
Of course I'm surprised!

00:09:54.493 --> 00:09:57.519
I wasn't talking to you.
I was asking the king.

00:09:58.297 --> 00:09:59.662
I already knew.

00:10:22.355 --> 00:10:26.291
Long time no see.
I suppose those words are appropriate.

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:32.424
When I look at you,
I'm reminded of the distant past.

00:10:33.065 --> 00:10:35.033
Prince Seien.

00:10:36.669 --> 00:10:39.263
So Seiran is Prince Seien.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.575
They're quick to get away.

00:10:57.523 --> 00:10:58.615
Your Majesty.

00:11:01.861 --> 00:11:04.762
Carry out my orders immediately!

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.388
Arrest Advisor Sa!

00:11:06.866 --> 00:11:09.357
You'll likely find
Seiran there, too.

00:11:09.435 --> 00:11:10.333
Right!

00:11:10.403 --> 00:11:11.927
And you, Your Majesty?

00:11:12.038 --> 00:11:15.064
Shurei is in the Ministry of
the Enlightened One's Cave. I'll go.

00:11:15.141 --> 00:11:17.939
- The Enlightened One's Cave?
- It's dangerous.

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.739
This is obviously a trap.

00:11:19.812 --> 00:11:23.714
It likely is.
But I've gotta jump right in.

00:11:23.783 --> 00:11:25.546
I will bring Shurei back!

00:11:26.252 --> 00:11:29.483
Back when I was serving
the former king...

00:11:29.555 --> 00:11:32.115
...it was a time of constant warfare.

00:11:32.692 --> 00:11:35.957
Sho, So, and I fought together
on the battlefield...

00:11:36.028 --> 00:11:38.861
...doing whatever
we could to get ahead.

00:11:39.331 --> 00:11:41.629
I wanted to elevate the position
of the Sa Family...

00:11:41.701 --> 00:11:43.965
...ranked lowest
among the Seven Families.

00:11:44.036 --> 00:11:48.564
I served the former king
with only that thought in mind.

00:11:49.175 --> 00:11:53.612
You've already accomplished that.
Your power and rank are unshakable.

00:11:53.846 --> 00:11:57.839
You've become one of the advisors
with hundreds of ministers under you.

00:11:58.317 --> 00:12:01.377
Why do you find it necessary
to do something like this now?

00:12:01.454 --> 00:12:03.922
It's a gamble.

00:12:03.989 --> 00:12:04.978
A gamble?

00:12:05.057 --> 00:12:10.154
Things were fine when my goal was to
be at the top of the Seven Families.

00:12:10.229 --> 00:12:13.198
But then I realized something.

00:12:13.265 --> 00:12:16.701
No matter how I tried,
I would never be at the very top.

00:12:16.769 --> 00:12:20.705
That man will always be above me.

00:12:21.741 --> 00:12:23.106
Advisor Sho.

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:29.804
No matter how much effort I gave,
I could never reach Sho's level.

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:33.381
I guess that's the type of person
we define as "genius".

00:12:33.552 --> 00:12:36.077
But you rose to
the position of advisor.

00:12:36.355 --> 00:12:38.687
I'm just an ordinary man.

00:12:38.758 --> 00:12:41.784
Success, honor, status and power...

00:12:41.861 --> 00:12:46.264
...these things sustained me as I
climbed my way up to where I am now.

00:12:46.599 --> 00:12:48.624
However, it was different with Sho.

00:12:48.701 --> 00:12:52.694
He was sincerely devoted to
serving the king, and nothing else.

00:12:52.872 --> 00:12:56.171
Status and power
do not matter to him.

00:12:56.242 --> 00:13:01.179
It's as if he has no desire for anything
beyond his mere existence.

00:13:04.283 --> 00:13:08.811
That's the reason why I hate Sho.

00:13:08.954 --> 00:13:13.914
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:13:14.827 --> 00:13:16.089
You hate him?

00:13:16.395 --> 00:13:18.886
He showed me all too clearly
the difference between him...

00:13:18.964 --> 00:13:21.432
...and an ordinary man like me.

00:13:22.134 --> 00:13:25.865
I have no regrets about
living my life this way.

00:13:25.938 --> 00:13:28.429
My wishes have almost
all been fulfilled.

00:13:28.707 --> 00:13:32.643
However, there's still one
that remains.

00:13:33.012 --> 00:13:34.980
To rise above Sho.

00:13:35.548 --> 00:13:38.016
This is now my only wish.

00:13:38.217 --> 00:13:43.280
How will he respond to this?
Will I be able to surpass him?

00:13:43.589 --> 00:13:45.056
It's a gamble.

00:13:45.991 --> 00:13:47.583
I've grown old.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.493
And this is a gamble I can afford
because of that.

00:13:51.096 --> 00:13:54.259
I have no attachment to
what little of this life I have left.

00:13:54.333 --> 00:13:56.858
This is my first and last gamble.

00:13:57.269 --> 00:14:00.761
Constructing this life of mine
has been like painting a dragon.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:03.707
All that's lacking
is the finishing touch.

00:14:04.009 --> 00:14:06.637
And for this, Shurei is...!

00:14:18.624 --> 00:14:20.148
Where am I?

00:14:22.494 --> 00:14:24.621
Who did this to me, and why?

00:14:25.931 --> 00:14:29.662
There's no benefit to kidnapping me.

00:14:30.436 --> 00:14:35.032
I did not anticipate
Ryuki becoming so fond of her.

00:14:35.307 --> 00:14:40.404
But he made it clear he would prefer
that girl to my own granddaughter...

00:14:40.479 --> 00:14:42.504
...so that was no longer an option.

00:14:42.581 --> 00:14:45.175
And then, as I was thinking about
what to do next...

00:14:45.251 --> 00:14:49.813
...I learned of your existence,
Prince Seien.

00:14:50.256 --> 00:14:51.951
I am not Seien!

00:14:52.024 --> 00:14:56.120
Your eyes are identical to those of
the former king when he was young.

00:14:56.195 --> 00:14:57.253
I...!

00:14:57.329 --> 00:15:01.231
Well, if you insist on denying it,
that's fine.

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:05.634
However, once people learn
of Prince Seien's return...

00:15:05.704 --> 00:15:09.697
...there will be many
wanting you to take the throne.

00:15:09.975 --> 00:15:12.842
Saiunkoku's only king is Ryuki!

00:15:12.912 --> 00:15:16.973
Would you really want to risk repeating
the struggle of eight years ago?!

00:15:17.049 --> 00:15:20.212
There's no need to go through
anything like that.

00:15:20.519 --> 00:15:23.920
If Ryuki were to disappear... Yes.

00:15:23.989 --> 00:15:26.651
Perhaps through, say,
an unfortunate accident...!

00:15:33.299 --> 00:15:35.995
Darkness or not,
so long as Shurei is in there...!

00:15:43.042 --> 00:15:44.202
Who's there?

00:15:44.276 --> 00:15:45.607
He's here.

00:15:48.147 --> 00:15:50.877
This is about to get interesting.

00:15:58.924 --> 00:16:03.418
I will be waiting with your throne,
Prince Seien.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.459
What have you done to Ryuki?!

00:16:07.066 --> 00:16:10.502
You still care so deeply
for your younger brother.

00:16:10.569 --> 00:16:16.030
You were the only one who ever
truly loved the lonely Ryuki.

00:16:16.108 --> 00:16:19.134
Was it because you'd gone through
the same experience yourself?

00:16:19.211 --> 00:16:20.371
You're wrong!

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:24.240
He was the only one who loved
and respected me!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:27.280
Purely and innocently,
without ulterior motive.

00:16:27.619 --> 00:16:30.486
I was the one who found comfort
being with him.

00:16:31.457 --> 00:16:35.291
It was because of Ryuki that I was able
to go on living in the Royal Palace!

00:16:35.694 --> 00:16:37.787
I was the one who loved him!

00:16:38.364 --> 00:16:39.388
Tell me!

00:16:39.465 --> 00:16:41.092
What have you done to Ryuki?!

00:16:41.867 --> 00:16:44.461
It appears that it's gonna take
a little more convincing...

00:16:44.536 --> 00:16:46.299
...to have you take the throne.

00:16:46.372 --> 00:16:48.101
That would be impossible!

00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:52.201
You've been blinded by ambition.
How foolish of you, Advisor Sa!

00:16:52.711 --> 00:16:54.440
How dare you.

00:17:12.898 --> 00:17:13.922
Ryuki!

00:17:14.533 --> 00:17:17.991
It would be impossible for you
to have me take the throne.

00:17:18.604 --> 00:17:22.404
A new era in the Royal Court
has already begun.

00:17:23.008 --> 00:17:24.942
Your time has come and gone.

00:17:25.244 --> 00:17:27.235
Shuei Ran and Koyu Ri...

00:17:27.312 --> 00:17:30.748
...have already chosen their master
and pledged their loyalty to him.

00:17:31.316 --> 00:17:34.843
If a puppet king were to
take the throne...

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:39.357
...they and I, would take you down
without the slightest hesitation.

00:17:40.826 --> 00:17:45.820
The thing about my younger brother is,
he's not as stupid as you think.

00:17:46.198 --> 00:17:50.567
And as for me,
I'm not as obedient as you think either.

00:17:51.003 --> 00:17:54.131
So it would seem.
In that case...

00:17:54.606 --> 00:17:56.801
...I'll have to make you obedient!

00:18:07.486 --> 00:18:12.321
There are many ways to turn
a disobedient person into a puppet.

00:18:12.558 --> 00:18:13.923
- Seize him!
- Yes, sir!

00:18:27.439 --> 00:18:29.566
A lovely scent, is it not?

00:18:31.443 --> 00:18:32.910
Advisor Sa!

00:18:33.178 --> 00:18:37.274
When you wake up,
you shall be on the throne.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.358
No one told us this guy
would be so skilled!

00:18:50.529 --> 00:18:52.190
Where is Shurei?!

00:19:02.141 --> 00:19:05.338
Over here.
The princess is here.

00:19:06.478 --> 00:19:08.070
Is that really Shurei?!

00:19:08.147 --> 00:19:11.480
Yeah. Although her mouth's covered,
so I can't let you hear her voice.

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:14.178
Now then,
throw away your weapon.

00:19:16.255 --> 00:19:17.688
N-No!

00:19:18.757 --> 00:19:24.923
That's not me!
They're both assassins trying to kill you!

00:19:33.238 --> 00:19:35.035
That's a good boy.

00:19:35.707 --> 00:19:38.232
Don't go over there! Ryuki!

00:19:44.716 --> 00:19:46.149
Take him away.

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:22.948
What's going on?

00:20:23.555 --> 00:20:28.720
The king knows you're behind this.
General Ran will be here in a moment.

00:20:29.795 --> 00:20:30.955
How?!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:35.992
The young girl you brought to the
Royal Harem, Korin, led us to you.

00:20:36.068 --> 00:20:37.558
Korin, you say?

00:20:37.636 --> 00:20:39.695
I never told her a thing!

00:20:52.651 --> 00:20:55.745
I'm sorry, Enjun.

00:20:57.756 --> 00:21:01.351
At some point,
Korin came to realize your intentions.

00:21:01.693 --> 00:21:05.754
In order to help you,
who she so adores...

00:21:05.831 --> 00:21:08.026
...she planned to kill
Consort Shurei on her own.

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:10.830
It was through her
that we were led to you.

00:21:12.471 --> 00:21:16.134
As I recall, you found Korin collapsed
and near death in front of your gate...

00:21:16.208 --> 00:21:18.904
...eight years ago during the time of
the fight for the throne...

00:21:18.977 --> 00:21:21.002
...and you took her in, right?

00:21:26.985 --> 00:21:28.452
Enjun.

00:21:29.421 --> 00:21:31.184
What is it, Korin?

00:21:31.356 --> 00:21:33.017
Um... here.

00:21:33.525 --> 00:21:37.291
I embroidered it myself.
I hope you can use it.

00:21:38.497 --> 00:21:39.794
Korin!

00:21:40.499 --> 00:21:42.194
Ironic, isn't it?

00:21:42.267 --> 00:21:46.863
Your good conscience was ultimately
instrumental in your downfall.

00:21:47.372 --> 00:21:48.896
Impossible!

00:21:48.974 --> 00:21:51.340
Shusui never mentioned
anything like this.

00:21:52.144 --> 00:21:55.910
Shusui? If you're referring to
the assassin I know by that name...

00:21:55.981 --> 00:21:58.711
...she is, without a doubt,
a member of the Wolves of Wind.

00:22:01.586 --> 00:22:05.886
That woman will only take orders
from the former king and myself...

00:22:07.092 --> 00:22:09.322
...and of course, Advisor Sho.

00:22:12.297 --> 00:22:15.630
I see now.
That would explain it.

00:22:22.407 --> 00:22:25.808
He had me dancing in
the palm of his hand once again...

00:22:25.877 --> 00:22:29.643
...right up until the very last moment.

00:22:30.115 --> 00:22:31.377
Sho!

00:22:31.717 --> 00:22:32.684
And...

00:22:33.218 --> 00:22:38.554
...to think that you were the legendary
assassin, Black Wolf!

00:22:38.623 --> 00:22:42.457
You did an excellent job managing
to keep it a secret from us until now.

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:47.657
Go ahead, take the prince.

00:22:50.836 --> 00:22:55.773
But you're not the one
I'm giving this life of mine to.

00:23:09.354 --> 00:23:11.720
Really, you can be
so reckless.

00:23:22.768 --> 00:23:24.702
Don't go, Ryuki!

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:26.865
Don't go over there!

00:23:27.072 --> 00:23:28.972
RYUKI!!

00:23:30.575 --> 00:23:35.672
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.881 --> 00:23:42.218
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.521 --> 00:23:47.481
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.692 --> 00:23:52.789
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.799 --> 00:23:58.202
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.738 --> 00:24:04.869
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.644 --> 00:24:16.213
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.088 --> 00:24:22.685
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.094 --> 00:24:28.157
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.034 --> 00:24:34.597
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.973 --> 00:24:41.845
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.016 --> 00:24:46.017
Next Episode

00:24:46.017 --> 00:24:48.053
Next Episode
My work here is finished.

00:24:48.053 --> 00:24:48.653
Next Episode
He Who Swims a Lot will Drown

00:24:48.653 --> 00:24:50.956
Next Episode
He Who Swims a Lot will Drown
Despite everything that's happened,
I enjoyed it here.

00:24:50.956 --> 00:24:51.790
Next Episode
He Who Swims a Lot will Drown

00:24:51.790 --> 00:24:53.358
Next Episode
He Who Swims a Lot will Drown
Now then, Advisor Sho!

00:24:53.358 --> 00:24:53.391
Next Episode
He Who Swims a Lot will Drown

00:24:53.391 --> 00:24:54.326
Next Episode
He Who Swims a Lot will Drown
The five hundred gold coins
you promised me, hand it over!

00:24:54.326 --> 00:24:56.794
The five hundred gold coins
you promised me, hand it over!
